citation></ref></ref-list></back><floats-wrap><fig id="F1" position="float"><label>Fig. (1)</label><caption><p>Overview of the construction and analysis of microarray compendia. Datasets generated by different laboratories can be combined to create single-platform compendia or cross-platform compendia. Methods for meta-analysis are applicable on single- and cross-platform compendia, and they can be classified as direct or indirect analyses. The methods for classification and biclustering described in this review correspond to direct analysis only.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="CG-9-525_F1"/></fig></floats-wrap></article>